Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Conditional Logic Not Working
Problem: Tasks are not executing when expected

Solution: Check your conditional syntax and variable types:

# Incorrect - comparing string to boolean
when: install_package == "true"

# Correct - proper boolean comparison
when: install_package == true
when: install_package | bool
Issue 2: Loop Variables Not Accessible
Problem: Cannot access loop variables in nested structures

Solution: Use loop_control to customize variable names:

- name: Process complex data
  debug:
    msg: "{{ current_item.name }}"
  loop: "{{ complex_list }}"
  loop_control:
    loop_var: current_item
Issue 3: Undefined Variables in Conditionals
Problem: Playbook fails when variables are undefined

Solution: Use default values and proper variable checking:

when: my_variable is defined and my_variable == "expected_value"
when: (my_variable | default('')) != ''
